#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:104
msgid "Search or add task"
msgstr "Opgaav söken oder tofögen"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:105
msgid ""
"This is a combined field. As long as you do not type ENTER, it acts as a "
"filter. Then, only tasks that match your input are shown. As soon as you "
"type ENTER, your input is used as name to create a new task."
msgstr ""
"Dit is en Feld mit Dubbelfunkschoon. As lang, as Du nich de Ingaavtast "
"bruukst, warkt dat as Filter - denn warrt bloots Opgaven wiest, op de Dien "
"Ingaav passt; man bruukst Du de Ingaavtast, warrt en nieg Opgaav mit Dien "
"Ingaav as Naam opstellt."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:161
msgid "Cannot create new file."
msgstr "Nieg Datei lett sik nich opstellen."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:174 timetrackerwidget.cpp:415
msgid "Untitled"
msgstr "ahn Naam"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:270
msgid "Start &New Session"
msgstr "&Nieg Törn anfangen"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:271
msgid "Starts a new session"
msgstr "Fangt en nieg Törn an"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:271
msgid ""
"This will reset the session time to 0 for all tasks, to start a new session, "
"without affecting the totals."
msgstr ""
"Sett de Törntiet vun all Opgaven torüch op 0. En nieg Törn fangt an, man de "
"Heeltieden blievt."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:274
msgid "Edit History..."
msgstr "Vörgeschicht bewerken..."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:275
msgid "Edits history of all tasks of the current document"
msgstr "De Vörgeschicht vun all Opgaven vun't aktuelle Dokment bewerken"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:275
msgid ""
"A window will be opened where you can change start and stop times of tasks "
"or add a comment to them."
msgstr ""
"Binnen en nieg Finster kannst Du de Opgaven ehr Anfang- un Anholltieden "
"bewerken oder dor Kommentaren tofögen."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:278
msgid "&Reset All Times"
msgstr "&All Tieden torüchsetten"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:279
msgid "Resets all times"
msgstr "Sett all Tieden torüch"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:279
msgid ""
"This will reset the session and total time to 0 for all tasks, to restart "
"from scratch."
msgstr ""
"Sett de Törn- un de Heeltieden för all Opgaven torüch op 0, Du fangst denn "
"heel nieg an."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:281
msgid "&Start"
msgstr "&Anmaken"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:282
msgid "Starts timing for selected task"
msgstr "Maakt de Klock för de utsöchte Opgaav an"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:282
msgid ""
"This will start timing for the selected task.\n"
"It is even possible to time several tasks simultanously.\n"
"\n"
"You may also start timing of tasks by double clicking the left mouse button "
"on a given task. This will, however, stop timing of other tasks."
msgstr ""
"Maakt de Klock för de utsöchte Opgaav an.\n"
"Du kannst ok Klocken för mehr Opgaven op eenmaal lopen laten.\n"
"\n"
"Du kannst en Klock ok starten, wenn Du mit den linken Muusknoop dubbelt op "
"en Opgaav klickst, man denn hollt de Klocken för anner Opgaven an."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:287
msgid "S&top"
msgstr "Utmaken"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:288
msgid "Stops timing of the selected task"
msgstr "Maakt de Klock för de utsöchte Opgaav ut"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:289
msgid "Stop &All Timers"
msgstr "&All Klocken utmaken"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:290
msgid "Stops all of the active timers"
msgstr "Maakt all lopen Klocken ut"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:291
msgid "Track Active Applications"
msgstr "Aktive Programmen beluern"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:292
msgid ""
"Auto-creates and updates tasks when the focus of the current window has "
"changed"
msgstr ""
"Stellt Opgaven automaatsch op un frischt se ok op, wenn dat aktuelle Finster "
"wesselt"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:293
msgid ""
"If the focus of a window changes for the first time when this action is "
"enabled, a new task will be created with the title of the window as its name "
"and will be started. If there already exists such an task it will be started."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, warrt en nieg Opgaav opstellt un ehr Klock anmaakt, fuurts "
"wenn Du dat eerste Maal en anner Finster aktiev maakst. De Finstertitel "
"warrt as Opgaavnaam bruukt. Gifft dat al en Opgaav mit dissen Naam, warrt "
"ehr Klock anmaakt."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:297
msgid "&New Task..."
msgstr "&Nieg Opgaav..."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:297
msgid "Creates new top level task"
msgstr "Stellt en nieg Hööftopgaav op"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:298
msgid "This will create a new top level task."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du en nieg Hööftopgaav opstellen"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:299
msgid "New &Subtask..."
msgstr "Nieg Ünne&ropgaav..."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:300
msgid "Creates a new subtask to the current selected task"
msgstr "Stellt en nieg Ünneropgaav vun de opstunns utsöchte Opgaav op"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:301
msgid "This will create a new subtask to the current selected task."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du de opstunns utsöchte Opgaav en nieg Ünneropgaav tofögen"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:302
msgid "&Delete"
msgstr "&Wegdoon"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:302
msgid "Deletes selected task"
msgstr "Deit de utsöchte Opgaav weg"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:303
msgid "This will delete the selected task and all its subtasks."
msgstr "Deit de utsöchte Opgaav un all ehr Ünneropgaven weg"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:305
msgid "&Edit..."
msgstr "&Bewerken..."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:306
msgid "Edits name or times for selected task"
msgstr "Den Naam un de Tieden vun de opstunns utsöchte Opgaav bewerken"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:306
msgid ""
"This will bring up a dialog box where you may edit the parameters for the "
"selected task."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du den Naam un de Tieden vun de opstunns utsöchte Opgaav binnen "
"den Dialoog bewerken"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:308
msgid "&Mark as Complete"
msgstr "As Afslaten &markeren"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:310
msgid "&Mark as Incomplete"
msgstr "As Nich afslaten &markeren"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:312
msgid "&Export Times..."
msgstr "Tieden &exporteren..."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:314
msgid "Export &History..."
msgstr "&Vörgeschicht exporteren..."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:316
msgid "Import Tasks From &Planner..."
msgstr "Opgaven ut den &Planer importeren..."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:318
msgid "Show Searchbar"
msgstr "Söökbalken wiesen"

