msgctxt "@info in message box"
msgid ""
"There is no history yet. Start and stop a task and you will have an entry in "
"your history."
msgstr ""
"Dat gifft noch keen Vörgeschicht. De gifft dat eerst, wenn Du en Opgaavklock "
"startst un wedder anhöllst."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:758
msgid "Do you really want to reset the time to zero for all tasks?"
msgstr "Wullt Du de Tiet för all Opgaven redig op 0 torüchsetten?"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:759
msgid "Confirmation Required"
msgstr "Beglöven"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:759
msgid "Reset All Times"
msgstr "All Tieden torüchsetten"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:914
msgid "Save failed, most likely because the file could not be locked."
msgstr "Sekern fehlslaan, wohrschienlich lett sik de Datei nich afsluten."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:916
msgid "Could not modify calendar resource."
msgstr "Kalennerressource lett sik nich ännern."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:918
msgid "Out of memory--could not create object."
msgstr "Keen Spieker över - Objekt lett sik nich opstellen."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:920
msgid "UID not found."
msgstr "UID lett sik nich finnen."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:922
msgid "Invalidate date--format is YYYY-MM-DD."
msgstr "Datum gellt nich - Formaat is JJJJ-MM-DD."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:924
msgid "Invalid time--format is YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS."
msgstr "Tiet gellt nich - Formaat is JJJJ-MM-DDTSS:mm:ss"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:926
msgid "Invalid task duration--must be greater than zero."
msgstr "Opgaavduer gellt nich - mutt grötter as 0 wesen."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:928
#, kde-format
msgid "Invalid error number: %1"
msgstr "Fehlernummer gellt nich: %1"

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:1127
msgid ""
"This is ktimetracker, KDE's program to help you track your time. Best, start "
"with creating your first task - enter it into the field where you see "
"\"search or add task\"."
msgstr ""
"Dit is dat Programm \"ktimetracker\", dor kannst Du Dien Tietverbruuk mit "
"opteken. Stell eenfach Dien eerst Opgaav op - giff sien Naam na't Feld "
"\"Opgaav söken oder tofögen\" in."

#: timetrackerwidget.cpp:1128
msgid "You have already created a task. You can now start and stop timing"
msgstr "Du hest al en Opgaav opstellt. Du kannst ehr Klock nu an- un utmaken."

